AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::setRewardRecipient()
├── when caller is not the exact creditAccount
│   ├── when caller is owner
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when caller is an authorized delegate of creditAccount
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount
│   └── when caller is unrelated
│       └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount
├── when caller is creditAccount
│   ├── when new recipient is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketZeroAddress
│   ├── when new recipient equals current recipient
│   │   ├── it should keep the same recipient
│   │   └── it should emit SetRewardRecipient with equal old and new values
│   └── when new recipient is nonzero
│       ├── it should update rewardRecipient
│       ├── it should emit SetRewardRecipient with old and new recipients
│       └── it should forward all configured rewards to the new recipient on later claims
└── when market is paused frozen or Convex inactive
    └── it should remain callable by creditAccount
